# Country maker pairs that were the same page twice. US/UK/Australia each
# publish ONE photo size that serves both the passport and the visa
# application, so the pair differed only in the word in the URL. The passport
# page survives in each case because it is the one the rest of the site links
# to (9, 8 and 4 inbound links versus 1, 0 and 0). Canada is deliberately NOT
# here as a pair: its printed booklet photo is 50x70mm and needs a commercial
# photographer's certification, so the passport page could only ever produce
# the 35x45mm visa image under a passport title. The visa page survives and
# carries the booklet caveat.
/us-visa-photo-maker/ /us-passport-photo-maker/ 301
/uk-visa-photo-maker/ /uk-passport-photo-maker/ 301
/australia-visa-photo-maker/ /australia-passport-photo-maker/ 301
/canada-passport-photo-maker/ /canada-visa-photo-maker/ 301

